   156	  need "s44 status line (§13 B1)" grep -qx $'ACEattn\t44\t0\t/home/yixunhu/codespace/flac-fork-attn/outputs_FLAC/exp30_ACEattn_s44/epoch=8-step=40000.ckpt' "$QSTATUS"
